<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Neimeth profits soar higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Neimeth profits soar higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year results for Nigerian drugs firm Neimeth International Pharmaceutical Products, formerly known as Pfizer, to end-May 1997. (In thousand naira)</p>
<p>				     1997	    1996</p>
<p> Turnover			  310,000 vs 325,000</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	 75,700 vs 97</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	  24,200 vs 31</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
